  "meta": {
    "count": 126,
    "notes": "Small iconic ASCII-art subjects for the Gen 1 NFT card center. Curated from classic, widely-shared, folk-style public-domain ASCII collections (asciiart.eu category pages and the Christopher Johnson ASCII Art Collection are the canonical homes for these pieces). Every piece is pure printable ASCII (0x20-0x7E), fits within 40 cols x 18 rows, and strongly favors <=30 cols / <=12 rows. width = longest line length, height = number of lines. NOTE: this environment blocked all live network access (WebFetch/WebSearch/curl all denied), so pieces were reconstructed from knowledge of these canonical public-domain collections rather than scraped byte-for-byte; source URLs point to the canonical category pages where each style lives. All entries validated pure-ASCII + size by script before writing."
